  "solution": {
    "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math><br />on comparison, we get,&nbsp;<br /><math><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">q</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>.</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> (given)<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mo>&#8201;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> Both sides are equal for <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>",
